# ankibase
===
 Self-hosted Anki in your browser, on your phone and on your computer: study your real Anki collection, play Quizlet sets in every mode, and turn your vocabulary into AI stories with tap-to-translate. Offline apps for Android, iPhone, Windows, macOS and Linux, AnkiWeb or your own sync server, multiple profiles, one-line install..
